Provenance (recorded by AnvilMac, 2026-11-10):
  DXMT upstream commit 0df86108348bab2aaa5c4610a5eb63a9de9047ac (https://github.com/3Shain/dxmt, main,
  2026-11-10), "fix(airconv): correct index buffer sentinel value check in gs converter" (DXMT contributors).
  License: LGPL-2.1-or-later (DXMT changes after v0.80). Applied verbatim (index line from 647b002).
  Fixes upstream 914ae9a (2026-10-26): a draw without an index buffer through a geometry shader took the indexed
  path and its vertex stage failed to convert ("Failed to create mesh PSO: Invalid vertex shader."). Seen in
  Void's Cave (Unreal Engine 5 demo, black 3D scene) on 11.19-16 as first built; with this change an original
  no-window D3D11 probe draws both Draw and DrawIndexed, and Void's Cave draws at 60 fps without errors (owner,
  2026-11-10). Found and tested here independently; the same one-line fix landed upstream the same day.

